# ==============================================================================
# FKST — Frontend Environment Variables (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
#
# The frontend is a fully STATIC site (an Introduction page and a Get Started
# guide). It makes no backend or auth calls, so it needs NO environment
# configuration to build or run — `npm run dev` / `npm run build` work as-is.
#
# SECURITY: Never place secrets here. Any variable prefixed with VITE_ is
# embedded into the client bundle in plain text and is publicly visible.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: dashboard backend
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Base URL of the fkst-hosted backend, used ONLY by the authenticated Dashboard
# (GitHub login + the sessions view). Leave UNSET for the default SAME-ORIGIN
# deployable topology (one ingress fronts the SPA and the backend — see
# k8s_sample/ingress.yaml); set it only for a cross-origin backend (which must
# then allow this origin via CORS).
#
# Example:
# VITE_FKST_API_BASE=https://api.hosted.chronoai.co

# Opt-out for a standalone docs-only hosting of the static site (no backend
# anywhere): the Dashboard tab then shows a "backend not configured" note
# instead of attempting sign-in/API calls.
# VITE_FKST_DOCS_ONLY=true
